  "notes": "{利用|りよう} means to use or make use of something for a purpose. More formal and purposeful than {使|つか}う.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{利用|りよう}する: to use ~\n- {利用|りよう}できる: can use / is available\n- ご{利用|りよう}ください: please use (polite, seen on signs)\n- {有効|ゆうこう}に{利用|りよう}する: to make effective use of\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {利用|りよう}{者|しゃ}: user\n- {利用|りよう}{料|りょう}: usage fee\n- {利用|りよう}{規約|きやく}: terms of use/service\n- {利用|りよう}{可能|かのう}: available for use\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {使|つか}う: to use (general, everyday)\n- {利用|りよう}する: to utilize, to make use of (purposeful, formal)\n- {活用|かつよう}する: to put to practical use, to leverage",
